<div class="mco-section section">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="mco-section__header">
      <h1 class="mco-section__title">{{ section.settings.title | default: 'Market Schedule Conflicts' }}</h1>
      <p class="mco-section__subtitle">
        {{ section.settings.description | default: 'Scheduling conflicts between your farmers-market calendar events. All times in America/Chicago timezone (CDT during summer, CST in winter).' }}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div id="market-overlap-results" class="mco-results">
      <p class="mco-loading">Calculating schedule conflicts&hellip;</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mco-notes">
      <h3>Data notes</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Wicker Park FM</strong> has additional excluded dates (EXDATEs) in the source .ics file that are not fully enumerated &mdash; actual conflicts involving this market may be fewer than shown.</li>
        <li><strong>Andersonville FM</strong> and <strong>Naperville FM</strong> also carry EXDATEs not fully specified in the calendar summary.</li>
        <li><strong>Park Ridge FM</strong> has a schedule override on 2026-06-27 whose exact new hours were not provided; it is shown here with its regular 05:30&ndash;14:00 window.</li>
        <li><strong>Logan Square FM</strong> excludes its regular 2026-05-17 recurrence but adds an extra one-off event that day at the same hours (06:30&ndash;15:00).</li>
        <li><strong>Lake Geneva</strong> one-off dates are not included &mdash; exact date/time data was not specified in the uploaded calendar.</li>
        <li>Ravinia and Hinsdale one-off times are converted from UTC to America/Chicago local time (CDT, UTC&minus;5 during summer): 11:00Z&rarr;06:00&nbsp;CDT and 10:30Z&rarr;05:30&nbsp;CDT respectively.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<style>
  /* ── layout ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .mco-section {
    padding: 5rem 0 6rem;
  }

  .mco-section__header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .mco-section__title {
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 4vw, 4.4rem);
  }

  .mco-section__subtitle {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: #666;
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin: 0.8rem auto 0;
  }

  /* ── results container ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .mco-results {
    max-width: 84rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .mco-loading {
    text-align: center;
    color: #888;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
  }

  .no-conflicts {
    text-align: center;
    color: #4caf50;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }

  /* ── summary banner ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .mco-banner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.6rem;
    background: #fff8e1;
    border: 2px solid #ffb300;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 2rem 2.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.2rem;
  }

  .mco-banner__icon {
    font-size: 3rem;
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .mco-banner__heading {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    color: #795600;
  }

  .mco-banner__sub {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #5a4000;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── date cards ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .mco-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.4rem;
  }

  .mco-date {
    background: #f8f9fa;
    border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 1.8rem 2.2rem;
  }

  .mco-date--first {
    background: #fff5f5;
    border-color: #e53935;
  }

  .mco-date__heading {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-primary, #2c2c2c);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  .mco-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #e53935;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    padding: 0.2em 0.6em;
    border-radius: 4px;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  /* ── conflict pairs ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .mco-pairs {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }

  .mco-pair {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .mco-pair__name {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary, #2c2c2c);
  }

  .mco-pair__times {
    color: #555;
  }

  .mco-pair__vs {
    color: #e53935;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0.2rem;
  }

  /* ── notes box ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .mco-notes {
    max-width: 84rem;
    margin: 4rem auto 0;
    padding: 2rem 2.4rem;
    background: #f1f3f4;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .mco-notes h3 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .mco-notes ul {
    padding-left: 2rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .mco-notes li {
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .mco-banner {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .mco-pair {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }
  }
</style>

<script src="{{ 'market-calendar.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Market Calendar Overlap",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "market-calendar-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Page Title",
      "default": "Market Schedule Conflicts"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "description",
      "label": "Description",
      "default": "Scheduling conflicts between your farmers-market calendar events. All times in America/Chicago timezone (CDT during summer, CST in winter)."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Market Calendar Overlap"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
